talking much more about this

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.870
but I just feel like
this is really important,

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:04.609
just to reiterate to us as creators

00:11:04.609 --> 00:11:06.660
that we need to keep creating.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:09.210
If you, as a person who is
watching content creators,

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:10.719
